Description: Handy tools for cardiometabolic epidemiology, including the PREVENT
    and Pooled Cohort Equations risk scores, insulin sensitivity and resistance
    indices, GLI-2012 and GLI Global spirometry reference equations, and Human Metabolome
    Database lookups.
